{"seq":2,"slug":"science-pioneer","title":"科学的先驱","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/science-pioneer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anticipating-modern-science","title":"预见近代科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/science-pioneer/anticipating-modern-science","wordCount":1429,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-fusion-of-disciplines","title":"学科的融合","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/science-pioneer/the-fusion-of-disciplines","wordCount":1421,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学的先驱\">科学的先驱</h1><p>达·芬奇以超前的思想预见了近代科学，留下融合的启示。本章考察其科学遗产。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;预见近代科学&quot;——他的科学方法与超前发现如何成为近代科学的先声。第二篇文档讲述&quot;学科的融合&quot;,呈现他贯通万物的实践对现代的永恒启示。</p>\n"}